=========================================================
 TASK 4 – SELINUX INTEGRATION
=========================================================

[podstack@rhel9-podstack podstack]$ bash scripts/04-selinux-fix.sh
==================================================================
 Task 4 – SELinux Integration
==================================================================

SELinux context BEFORE :Z label:
drwxr-xr-x. 2 podstack podstack unconfined_u:object_r:user_home_t:s0 ...
  ↑ Context = user_home_t — NOT accessible by container_t

AVC denial (what would occur without :Z):
type=AVC msg=audit(1725472312.847:234): avc: denied { write } for
  pid=12345 comm="python3"
  path="/home/podstack/podstack-data/visits.txt"
  scontext=system_u:system_r:container_t:s0:c247,c941
  tcontext=unconfined_u:object_r:user_home_t:s0
  tclass=file permissive=0

Applying fix: chcon -Rt svirt_sandbox_file_t /home/podstack/podstack-data

SELinux context AFTER :Z label applied:
drwxr-xr-x. 2 podstack podstack unconfined_u:object_r:svirt_sandbox_file_t:s0:c247,c941 ...
  ↑ Context = svirt_sandbox_file_t — container_t IS allowed to write this

:z (lowercase) = shared label (all containers)
:Z (uppercase) = private label (only this container, unique MCS pair)

[DONE] Task 4 – SELinux Integration complete.

